    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The chapter details Maharashtra's economic structure across four core sectors: Economic Overview, Agriculture, Industries, and Transport.",
        "Agricultural analysis encompasses major crops, district-wise crop specialization, and state irrigation networks.",
        "Industrial coverage highlights Maharashtra Industrial Development Corporation (MIDC) areas, industrial clusters, and major headquartered organizations.",
        "Transport evaluation addresses four key logistics channels: Railways, Roads and Highways, Ports, and Aviation."
