    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3ykwa77",
      "content": "Maharashtra is India's wealthiest and most industrialized state, contributing approximately 14-15% to India's GDP. The state has a diversified economy with strong presence in manufacturing, services, IT, finance, agriculture, and trade."
    },
