    {
      "id": "47ayhck",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Irrigation in Maharashtra"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gb8qt2c",
      "content": "Maharashtra has significant irrigation potential but faces challenges in equitable distribution, especially in drought-prone Marathwada and parts of Vidarbha."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "CHAPTER 3: MAHARASHTRA ECONOMY AND AGRICULTURE",
      "id": "21vpbrd"
    },
    {
      "id": "kq1kb6q",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Total irrigated area: About 18-20% of agricultural land",
        "Major source: Canals (from large dams), wells, and lift irrigation",
        "Jayakwadi Project (Paithan Dam) – major irrigation in Marathwada",
        "Koyna Dam – major irrigation in Western Maharashtra",
        "Maharashtra Krishna Valley Development Corporation (MKVDC) – manages Krishna basin irrigation",
        "Vidarbha Irrigation Development Corporation (VIDC) – Vidarbha basin",
        "Konkan Irrigation Development Corporation (KIDC) – Konkan region"
      ]
    },
    {
